flowchart LR
  SRC[Partner order blob container/folder] -->|Azure Blob built-in trigger, 60 s| WF[wf-order-intake stateful workflow]
  WF --> TYPE[Well-formed XML and PurchaseOrder QName check]
  TYPE --> XSLT[PurchaseOrder to CanonicalOrder XSLT]
  XSLT --> PRICE[PricingRules local function]
  PRICE --> ROUTE{OrderTotal >= 5000}
  ROUTE -->|yes| APPROVAL[Approval blob container/folder]
  ROUTE -->|no| FULFIL[Fulfilment blob container/folder]
  WF -. processing failure .-> ERRORFN[ErrorMessageBuilder local function]
  ERRORFN --> ERRORS[Errors blob container/folder]
  MI[Workflow managed identity] --> SRC
  MI --> APPROVAL
  MI --> FULFIL
  MI --> ERRORS
  MI --> KV[Key Vault]
  WF --> AI[Application Insights]
